    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="359c257c-5c71-51a7-8db2-f16213f985b9" activityNameId="f4966eea-24eb-5348-977b-ef76a4639dbc" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, medium voltage, certified electricity, at grid</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, medium voltage, certified electricity, at grid
This dataset describes the transformation from high to medium voltage as well as the transmission of electricity at medium voltage.; UUID:3a2d5af5-4847-3b2b-ba4d-115b67948899
Included are the electricity production in Switzerland and from imports, the transmission network and direct SF6-emissions to air. Electricity losses during medium-voltage transmission and transformation from high-voltage are accounted for.
Location: Data apply to public and self producers. Geographical classification according to IEA.Transmission network, losses and emissions are taken from Itten, Frischknecht and Stucki (2014): LCI of Electricity Mixes and Grid.
Technology: Average technology used to transmit and distribute electricity. Includes underground and overhead lines, as well as air-, vacuum- and SF6-insulated high-to-medium voltage switching stations. Electricity production according to related datasets
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: 
Sampling: Statistical data
Extrapolations: 
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3a2d5af5-4847-3b2b-ba4d-115b67948899.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
